Z||000001||Rick 88||10-10-2001||10:46 PM||||There are many versions of 355 kits on the market. Is your a stock wheelbase, stretch, hardtop or spyder. <P>I have a local friend with a business that builds mostly Fiero based kit cars. It is a lot of work, and can get very expensive if you want the best parts. He no longer doing 355 kits because Ferrari is legally cracking down on all the kit manufactuers. You can get his e-mail at his site.  <A HREF="http://www.wild-rides.com" TARGET=_blank>www.wild-rides.com</A>   Maybe he can give you some pointers.<P>Rick 88||||reg||5
